<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Eurobit, Waterproofing & Construction Chemicals, Lahore</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --navy: #0d1b35;
      --navy-dark: #0a1628;
      --navy-card: #13233f;
      --orange: #f97316;
      --orange-hover: #ea6c0a;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --gray-light: #f5f5f5;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --text-body: #334155;
      --radius: 12px;
    }

    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; color: var(--text-body); background: #fff; }

    a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }

    /* ── TOP BAR ── */
    .topbar {
      background: var(--navy-dark);
      color: #cdd8e8;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 8px 48px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .topbar-left { display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center; }
    .topbar-left span, .topbar-left a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; color: #cdd8e8; }
    .topbar-left a:hover { color: var(--orange); }
    .topbar-right { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; }
    .topbar-right a { color: #cdd8e8; font-size: 16px; }
    .topbar-right a:hover { color: var(--orange); }

    /* ── NAV ── */
    nav {
      background: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 48px;
      height: 72px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8ecf0;
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    }
    .nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-right: 32px; }
    .logo-text { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); letter-spacing: -1px; }
    .logo-text span { color: var(--orange); }
    .logo-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; background: var(--orange); border-radius: 50%; margin-left: 2px; }
    .nav-sub { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #94a3b8; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-right: auto; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-body); letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .nav-links a.active { color: var(--orange); }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--orange); }
    .nav-cta {
      margin-left: 32px;
      background: var(--orange);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--orange-hover); color: #fff; }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      background: var(--navy);
      min-height: 92vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 80px 48px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero-bg {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: url('https://eurobit-glow-up.lovable.app/assets/hero-application-DKlxj0ur.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
      opacity: 0.18;
    }
    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 660px; }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(249,115,22,0.5);
      border-radius: 50px;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      color: #cdd8e8; text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .hero-badge svg { color: var(--orange); }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 64px);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #fff;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .hero h1 em { color: var(--orange); font-style: normal; }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      max-width: 540px;
    }
    .hero-btns { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--orange);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--orange-hover); color: #fff; }
    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { border-color: #fff; color: #fff; }

    /* ── STATS ── */
    .hero-stats {
      position: absolute; right: 48px; top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .stat-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px 36px;
      min-width: 240px;
    }
    .stat-card .num {
      font-size: 44px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--orange); line-height: 1;
    }
    .stat-card .label {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 6px;
    }

    /* ── TRUSTED BY ── */
    .trusted {
      background: #f9fafb;
      border-top: 1px solid #e8ecf0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8ecf0;
      padding: 24px 48px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 40px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .trusted-label {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .trusted-names {
      display: flex; gap: 36px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;
    }
    .trusted-names span {
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #475569;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* ── SECTION WRAPPER ── */
    .section { padding: 96px 48px; }
    .section-label {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: var(--orange); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .section h2 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 3.5vw, 48px); font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .section .sub {
      font-size: 16px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 480px;
    }
    .section-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .view-all {
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy);
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .view-all:hover { color: var(--orange); }

    /* ── PRODUCTS GRID ── */
    .products-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .product-card {
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .product-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.10); transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .product-card img { width: 100%; height: 220px; object-fit: cover; display: block; background: #e8ecf0; }
    .product-card .card-body { padding: 20px; }
    .product-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--navy);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 50px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .product-card h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .product-card p { font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.5; }
    .product-card:hover h3 { color: var(--orange); }

    /* ── ABOUT SECTION ── */
    .about-section {
      background: #f9fafb;
      padding: 96px 48px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .about-img-wrap { border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
    .about-img-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 420px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .about-meta { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b; margin-top: 12px; text-align: center; }
    .about-features { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin: 28px 0 36px; }
    .feature-item {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy);
    }
    .feature-item::before {
      content: '';
      width: 20px; height: 20px;
      background: var(--orange);
      border-radius: 50%;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* ── BLOG ── */
    .blog-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .blog-card {
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 32px;
      transition: box-shadow 0.2s;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .blog-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .blog-location {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .blog-card h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.3; }
    .blog-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .blog-link { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--orange); }
    .blog-card:hover .blog-link { text-decoration: underline; }

    /* ── CTA BAND ── */
    .cta-band {
      background: var(--navy);
      padding: 80px 48px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 40px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .cta-band h2 { font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 38px); font-weight: 900; color: #fff; max-width: 480px; line-height: 1.2; }
    .cta-band p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 10px; max-width: 420px; }
    .cta-btns { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    footer {
      background: var(--navy-dark);
      padding: 72px 48px 40px;
    }
    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }
    .footer-brand .logo-text { font-size: 28px; }
    .footer-brand p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 20px 0 28px; max-width: 340px; }
    .footer-contact { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
    .footer-contact a {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .footer-contact a:hover { color: var(--orange); }
    .footer-col h4 {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: var(--orange); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .footer-col ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
    .footer-col ul li a { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .footer-col ul li a:hover { color: var(--white); }
    .footer-bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      padding-top: 28px;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    }
    .footer-bottom p { color: #475569; font-size: 13px; }
    .made-in { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #475569; text-transform: uppercase; }

    /* ── ICONS SVG ── */
    svg { display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; }

    /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      .products-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .hero-stats { position: static; transform: none; margin-top: 48px; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .hero { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav, .topbar, .section, .about-section, .cta-band, footer { padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; }
      .products-grid, .blog-grid, .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .hero { padding: 60px 24px; }
      .hero-stats { flex-direction: column; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- TOP BAR -->
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-left">
      <span>
        <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5c-1.38 0-2.5-1.12-2.5-2.5S10.62 6.5 12 6.5s2.5 1.12 2.5 2.5S13.38 11.5 12 11.5z"/></svg>
        Lahore, Pakistan
      </span>
      <a href="mailto:info@eurobit.online">
        <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
        info@eurobit.online
      </a>
      <a href="tel:+924235710000">
        <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 013.07 9.82a19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.63A2 2 0 012 .18h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L6.09 8a16 16 0 006.91 6.91l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
        +92 42 3571 0000
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="topbar-right">
      <a href="#" aria-label="Facebook">
        <svg width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 2h-3a5 5 0 00-5 5v3H7v4h3v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V7a1 1 0 011-1h3z"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#" aria-label="YouTube">
        <svg width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22.54 6.42a2.78 2.78 0 00-1.95-1.96C18.88 4 12 4 12 4s-6.88 0-8.59.46A2.78 2.78 0 001.46 6.42 29 29 0 001 12a29 29 0 00.46 5.58 2.78 2.78 0 001.95 1.96C5.12 20 12 20 12 20s6.88 0 8.59-.46a2.78 2.78 0 001.95-1.96A29 29 0 0023 12a29 29 0 00-.46-5.58z"/><polygon points="9.75 15.02 15.5 12 9.75 8.98 9.75 15.02" fill="#0a1628"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav>
    <div class="nav-logo">
      <div class="logo-text">euro <span>bit</span></div>
      <div class="logo-dot"></div>
    </div>
    <span class="nav-sub">Waterproofing Ind.</span>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#" class="active">Home</a>
      <a href="#about">About Us</a>
      <a href="#products">Products</a>
      <a href="#news">News</a>
      <a href="#location">Location</a>
    </div>
    <a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Contact Us</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="var(--orange)" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        ISO 9001:2015 Certified Manufacturer
      </div>
      <h1>Waterproofing &amp; construction chemicals, <em>engineered in Lahore.</em></h1>
      <p>Eurobit manufactures modified bitumen membranes, concrete admixtures, and protective coatings, built to withstand Pakistan's monsoon rains, rising damp, and extreme summer heat.</p>
      <div class="hero-btns">
        <a href="#products" class="btn-primary">View Products →</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-outline">Request a Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="num">30+</div>
        <div class="label">Years Manufacturing</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="num">200+</div>
        <div class="label">Major Projects Delivered</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-card">
        <div class="num">9001</div>
        <div class="label">ISO Quality Certified</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUSTED BY -->
  <div class="trusted">
    <span class="trusted-label">Trusted by</span>
    <div class="trusted-names">
      <span>Nestlé</span>
      <span>Coca-Cola</span>
      <span>Toyota</span>
      <span>PepsiCo</span>
      <span>McDonald's</span>
      <span>KFC</span>
      <span>Shaukat Khanum</span>
      <span>Lahore Airport</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PRODUCTS -->
  <section class="section" id="products">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label">Our Catalogue</div>
        <h2>Products</h2>
        <p class="sub">Modified bitumen membranes, admixtures, and coatings, manufactured at our Lahore facility, conforming to ASTM standards.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="#products" class="view-all">View All →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="products-grid">
      <!-- Product cards, using placeholder images since originals are behind CDN -->
      <a href="#" class="product-card">
        <img src="https://eurobit-glow-up.lovable.app/assets/product-membrane-Qslt1mDA.jpg" alt="Eurobit 4170" onerror="this.style.background='#1e3a5f';this.removeAttribute('src')">
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="product-tag">Bitumen Membrane</span>
          <h3>Eurobit 4170 (3170 / 5170)</h3>
          <p>APP-modified torch-on membrane for roofs and foundations.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="product-card">
        <img src="https://eurobit-glow-up.lovable.app/assets/product-membrane-Qslt1mDA.jpg" alt="Eurobit 4170 SL" onerror="this.style.background='#1e3a5f';this.removeAttribute('src')">
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="product-tag">Bitumen Membrane</span>
          <h3>Eurobit 4170 SL</h3>
          <p>Slate-finish membrane for exposed rooftop applications.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="product-card">
        <img src="https://eurobit-glow-up.lovable.app/assets/product-membrane-Qslt1mDA.jpg" alt="Eurobit Garden" onerror="this.style.background='#1e3a5f';this.removeAttribute('src')">
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="product-tag">Bitumen Membrane</span>
          <h3>Eurobit Garden</h3>
          <p>Root-resistant membrane for planters and green roofs.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="product-card">
        <img src="https://eurobit-glow-up.lovable.app/assets/product-membrane-Qslt1mDA.jpg" alt="Eurobit Aluminium" onerror="this.style.background='#1e3a5f';this.removeAttribute('src')">
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="product-tag">Bitumen Membrane</span>
          <h3>Eurobit Aluminium</h3>
          <p>Aluminium-faced membrane, reflective and heat-resistant.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="product-card">
        <img src="https://eurobit-glow-up.lovable.app/assets/product-membrane-Qslt1mDA.jpg" alt="Euro-Plast SP" onerror="this.style.background='#1e3a5f';this.removeAttribute('src')">
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="product-tag">Admixture</span>
          <h3>Euro-Plast SP</h3>
          <p>Superplasticizer for high-strength concrete mixes.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="product-card">
        <img src="https://eurobit-glow-up.lovable.app/assets/product-membrane-Qslt1mDA.jpg" alt="Euro-Cure" onerror="this.style.background='#1e3a5f';this.removeAttribute('src')">
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="product-tag">Admixture</span>
          <h3>Euro-Cure</h3>
          <p>Concrete curing compound for slabs and pavements.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section class="about-section" id="about">
    <div class="about-img-wrap">
      <img src="https://eurobit-glow-up.lovable.app/assets/factory-UFF2R19b.jpg" alt="Eurobit manufacturing facility in Lahore" onerror="this.style.background='#1e3a5f';this.removeAttribute('src')">
      <p class="about-meta">Kot Lakhpat, Lahore &nbsp;·&nbsp; Own manufacturing facility since 1994</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">About Eurobit</div>
      <h2>Local precision.<br>Global standards.</h2>
      <p style="color:#64748b;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:28px;">Eurobit is a Lahore-based, ISO 9001:2015 certified manufacturer of modified bitumen membranes, concrete admixtures, and protective coatings, engineered for Pakistan's climate. We are registered with the Pakistan Engineering Council, Military Engineer Services, and the SECP.</p>
      <div class="about-features">
        <div class="feature-item">In-house manufacturing</div>
        <div class="feature-item">ASTM-compliant products</div>
